# WET PAINT: reaching course 13 earns the Beacon. The save keeps the score
# board (which starts out filled in by the Beamdown staff), the best course
# reached and whether the cup was won, and gives the goals back from them. A
# run is never saved half-way: only a finished run goes on the board.
wipe_saves
reload
game wetpaint
wait 5
expect hi0 == 400
expect hi4 == 100
expect best_course == 0
cheat course 12
cheat nofoes
cheat go
cheat wipe
cheat fill 1 200
cheat time 1
wait 2
expect res_pass == 1
expect goals & 1
expect goals !& 2
wait 220
expect course == 13
expect best_course == 13
# a game over puts the score on the board
cheat lives 1
cheat score 777
cheat go
cheat wipe
cheat time 1
wait 2
wait 220
expect state == 5
expect hi0 == 777
expect hi1 == 400
expect new_rank == 0
reload
game wetpaint
wait 5
expect hi0 == 777
expect best_course == 13
expect goals.wetpaint == 1
expect state == 0
